flowchart TD
  SB[Service Bus scan-jobs] --> Worker[Worker validates schema]
  Worker -->|valid| Process[Process scan]
  Worker -->|invalid schema/version| DLQ[Dead-letter]
  Process -->|success| Done[DONE + completeMessage]
  Process -->|handled failure| Failed[FAILED + scan_refunded + completeMessage]
  Process -->|transient infra error| Retry[abandon / retry by delivery count]
  Retry --> SB
  DLQ --> Stats[dlq-stats]
  DLQ --> Replay[controlled replay]
  DLQ --> Purge[documented purge only]